# DO NOT ADD files/ OR scripts/ HERE.
#
# .helmignore controls what `helm package` puts in the archive. Both directories hold the
# synced configs and scripts that the ConfigMap templates read with .Files.Get. Excluding
# either one produces a chart that lints, templates, packages and then fails at install
# with an empty ConfigMap - the templates carry an explicit `fail` for exactly that.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.tmproj
*.swp
*.bak
